#
# The keys whose signatures onu-update trusts (ADR 0022), one a line: the word
# ed25519, the raw public key in base64 and the key's name. The release
# workflow signs every release with the private half of the key below, which
# only it holds. A build of one's own may add a key of its own here; a file
# signed with no key of these still installs, and the panel says that it is
# no release.
ed25519 ymQRzCIep8hRSylvaFxCgLjX9aMRXjZlDMo6Qa4FQjs= open-dfp-34x-2c releases, key 1
